OL,3,AJust under one million young people not
OL,4,Ain work, education or training, figures
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FJust under one million young people in
OL,8,Fthe UK are not in education, employment
OL,9,For training, according to Office for
OL,10,FNational Statistics (ONS) data
OL,12,FThe latest figures suggest 981,000
OL,13,Fpeople aged 16 to 24 were Neet between
OL,14,FApril and June - an estimated 13% of
OL,15,Fthat age group
OL,17,FToday's figures are higher than those
OL,18,Ffor the same period last year
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
