OL,3,AJust under one million young people not
OL,4,Ain work, education or training, figures
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Labour minister Alan Milburn,
OL,8,Fwho authored a government-commissioned
OL,9,Freport on Neets, has previously said
OL,10,Fthe numbers showed this was "more than
OL,11,Fan economic crisis, it is a moral one"
OL,12,F- his final report is expected in the
OL,13,Fcoming weeks
OL,15,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,16,FMcFadden says the labour market is in a
OL,17,F"robust position" but there has been a
OL,18,F"long-term challenge for young people"
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
